},{"author":{"account":{"login":"0xNyk","providerType":"User"},"email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-17T06:52:37Z","committedDate":"2026-03-17T06:52:37Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:45:26.396Z","repositoryId":1218528157,"sha":"fc4384bba92ef9d704f42760ec697bb2f6caf2c4"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"0xNyk","providerType":"User"},"email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-17T06:52:34Z","committedDate":"2026-03-17T06:52:34Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:45:26.396Z","repositoryId":1218528157,"sha":"d0cd8701c7d403a473dc8bfa60f6492c60075e96"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"0xNyk","providerType":"User"},"email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-17T06:52:27Z","committedDate":"2026-03-17T06:52:27Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:45:26.396Z","repositoryId":1218528157,"sha":"2f2531f3d11f5473de2d38b0cf644dffc00ac7f7"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"0xNyk","providerType":"User"},"email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-17T06:52:09Z","committedDate":"2026-03-17T06:52:09Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:45:26.396Z","repositoryId":1218528157,"sha":"4671946e97fe75aa5bfc57a453ef2b400f92c704"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"0xNyk","providerType":"User"},"email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-17T05:54:55Z","committedDate":"2026-03-17T05:54:55Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:45:26.396Z","repositoryId":1218528157,"sha":"00a22a2e24e5496c71a9d184ac01faf47ae4e5b8"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"lucascr","providerType":"User"},"email":"lucascr@gmail.com","name":"Lucas Wiessel"},"authoredDate":"2026-03-17T05:51:10Z","committedDate":"2026-03-17T05:51:10Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:45:26.396Z","repositoryId":1218528157,"sha":"a4fefc882eef1a4300b8ab9ae56f81a8c799820c"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T22:45:26.396Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/fac2ca5b0b3dc6fd71302718fa98e14d49ad6875/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T02:08:45Z","email":"beboo@local","name":"beboopr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T02:08:45Z","email":"beboo@local","name":"beboopr"},"message":"docs(pi-deployment): add HTTPS-required + Tailscale Serve section\n\nAdd the missing piece nobody documents until they hit it: the dashboard\ngateway WebSocket cannot complete its handshake over plain HTTP because\nthe browser refuses WebCrypto.subtle outside a secure context. Document\nthe Tailscale Serve setup, MC env keys, the first-connect device\npairing approval, and how to roll back any LAN/Tailnet forwarders to\nreturn the gateway to loopback-only.","tree":{"sha":"b683e98c73849e99f75f577b4c3993c22592fb77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/trees/b683e98c73849e99f75f577b4c3993c22592fb77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/commits/fac2ca5b0b3dc6fd71302718fa98e14d49ad6875","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/fac2ca5b0b3dc6fd71302718fa98e14d49ad6875","node_id":"C_kwDOSKFDndoAKGZhYzJjYTViMGIzZGM2ZmQ3MTMwMjcxOGZhOThlMTRkNDlhZDY4NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/6c800f26e45def1907f423dd555750aa9ebd91a8","sha":"6c800f26e45def1907f423dd555750aa9ebd91a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/6c800f26e45def1907f423dd555750aa9ebd91a8"}],"sha":"fac2ca5b0b3dc6fd71302718fa98e14d49ad6875","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/fac2ca5b0b3dc6fd71302718fa98e14d49ad6875"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/6c800f26e45def1907f423dd555750aa9ebd91a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:44:11Z","email":"beboo@local","name":"beboopr"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-25T23:44:11Z","email":"beboo@local","name":"beboopr"},"message":"docs: add Pi + OpenClaw gateway deployment guide\n\nCompanion to docs/SECURITY-HARDENING.md. Documents the concrete config\nbehind the security checklist for a Raspberry Pi production deployment:\n\n- MC standalone build + .env (allowed hosts, HSTS, per-request cookie security)\n- Hardened ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json (minimal profile, deny lists, redaction)\n- systemd user unit with the sandbox subset that works on Pi OS userns\n- Emergency kill-switch via path watcher (touch ~/.openclaw/KILL)\n- UFW defense-in-depth + Cloudflare quick tunnel + Tailnet topology\n\nAll examples redacted of tokens/passwords; no live credentials in the doc.","tree":{"sha":"d7376e38ae03a3f79e2ea42c1f56acaccc7140d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/trees/d7376e38ae03a3f79e2ea42c1f56acaccc7140d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/commits/6c800f26e45def1907f423dd555750aa9ebd91a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/6c800f26e45def1907f423dd555750aa9ebd91a8","node_id":"C_kwDOSKFDndoAKDZjODAwZjI2ZTQ1ZGVmMTkwN2Y0MjNkZDU1NTc1MGFhOWViZDkxYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/a020d1b7d045e0e09616663ffb39963f432a3f4c","sha":"a020d1b7d045e0e09616663ffb39963f432a3f4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/a020d1b7d045e0e09616663ffb39963f432a3f4c"}],"sha":"6c800f26e45def1907f423dd555750aa9ebd91a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/6c800f26e45def1907f423dd555750aa9ebd91a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/a020d1b7d045e0e09616663ffb39963f432a3f4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-21T07:00:10Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-21T07:00:49Z","email":"0xnykcd@googlemail.com","name":"Nyk"},"message":"fix: gateway HTTPS/reverse-proxy, .env loading, DELETE pipeline, OpenCode part table\n\n- Fix gateway disconnection when accessing MC via HTTPS URL (closes #603):\n  - buildGatewayWebSocketUrl now respects NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_REVERSE_PROXY=1\n    to use wss:// for localhost when behind a reverse proxy\n  - Login page auto-selects wss:// preset when served over HTTPS\n  - Added ''wss://gateway:18789'' to login presets for container deployments\n  - Preserves user-explicit wss:// protocol for localhost URLs (reverse proxy)\n\n- Fix .env not loaded by pnpm start/dev (closes #603):\n  - start-standalone.sh now sources .env (consistent with Docker entrypoint)\n  - Added prominent note in .env.example about NEXT_PUBLIC_* build-time baking\n  - Documented NEXT_PUBLIC_GATEWAY_REVERSE_PROXY env var\n\n- Fix DELETE /api/pipelines returning 400 Request body required (closes #604):\n  - DELETE handler now accepts id from query string OR request body\n  - Frontend sends ?id=N, handler previously required JSON body\n\n- Fix OpenCode transcript showing only token counts (closes #593):\n  - readOpenCodeTranscript now queries the part table when available\n    (OpenCode >= 1.4 stores content in part, not message.data)\n  - Falls back to inline message.data.content for older versions\n  - Added test for part-table path with text and tool parts","tree":{"sha":"e3986389c538210079bcacc88c33e58545c3d43f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/trees/e3986389c538210079bcacc88c33e58545c3d43f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/commits/a020d1b7d045e0e09616663ffb39963f432a3f4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events