kgDODX8uZg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tomjwxf","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/36a252436437a61be1c174d9010ed9b662ffaf1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:40:34Z","email":"tomjwxf@gmail.com","name":"TJF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:40:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add Ed25519 receipt signing to MCP audit pipeline (#556)\n\nCloses #555.\n\nImplements tamper-evident audit receipts for MCP tool calls:\n\n- src/lib/receipt-signing.ts: Ed25519 signing with Node crypto (no deps)\n- Migration 050: adds payload_hash, signature, public_key columns\n- logMcpCall(): signs each record at write time (~0.3ms overhead)\n- verifyMcpCallReceipt() + verifyMcpCallReceipts(): integrity checks\n- GET /api/mcp-audit/verify: single-record or batch verification endpoint\n- Security scan integration: reports signed/unsigned ratio\n- Canonical JSON serialization (sorted keys) for deterministic hashing\n- Auto-generated keypair persisted in settings table\n- 147 lines of tests covering sign/verify/tamper/malformed inputs","tree":{"sha":"d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/trees/d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/commits/36a252436437a61be1c174d9010ed9b662ffaf1d","verification":{"payload":"tree d00a73f6458fe6a9f3813223a509e8111401fafe\nparent 2bb8bf6ed4afa44751029bd3da285d920776ba6b\nauthor TJF <tomjwxf@gmail.com> 1775842834 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775842834 +0700\n\nfeat: add Ed25519 receipt signing to MCP audit pipeline (#556)\n\nCloses #555.\n\nImplements tamper-evident audit receipts for MCP tool calls:\n\n- src/lib/receipt-signing.ts: Ed25519 signing with Node crypto (no deps)\n- Migration 050: adds payload_hash, signature, public_key columns\n- logMcpCall(): signs each record at write time (~0.3ms overhead)\n- verifyMcpCallReceipt() + verifyMcpCallReceipts(): integrity checks\n- GET /api/mcp-audit/verify: single-record or batch verification endpoint\n- Security scan integration: reports signed/unsigned ratio\n- Canonical JSON serialization (sorted keys) for deterministic hashing\n- Auto-generated keypair persisted in settings table\n- 147 lines of tests covering sign/verify/tamper/malformed inputs","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TYSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdZQQACLwF1HNLAV2yxKwgAuQH92C\nHgsrk+ORuocJr4S9zVp7SDnDTc3VwCFm2oOgBkFPw1hUcMjKVPMtDZyK843w3bln\ncGA0GBAgpAXMFsW+1HGdaQFAEH5ChYr+sadajSljc8FhgB/huDhUjH0GgTDhMqiU\nNds0yVkmjh/cSN/dnI4HmhqoKpn8yOf//jYdYICtS/fVm7DovRCVGFuTUvQPTa4C\nZe5lyFEFNuGqfUcalpfL9zGHuE+xwlbB9eAzqRE5bLkQEVkNdLPL1R3rkK+Irzln\nwuCbQPfDx1Hz8QXhk2qeNJv34LWPwyKzfN4yGEay3kvd7SNk8IqOujLl0x9fZcUE\n/RST8M97Oa0FaFHGXCHxlnEDHuZTXebTMzqV4wZwC3/VwOZALUzPF9zI3hDrJLUu\nKW6sZYpDdynUZNwOSJlIyai/cWdtW43C5Mpg/5l6crsWYrM21CocsAPE8AYVbZ4K\nCseWHRGC55LIdg0Wj22FDX5N45MbxSVmCowobtLKsj2tbcCtKdyPPyBYah5icOsG\nEYcjohgee/q2bxZ9TksJMkVA7b5Lplw8GX9MQatEwEx27QoAwcdXLOfxRVandgSK\nCWIT4y6NPLvAET/CJuzi77PXefeF8b4TmMJi6xFaRkyz/YtV1MJ5mdfkh+Kg8OSF\nhKEU4j0lNTj14Uj4q+i3\n=OcjX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T01:17:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/foll