 session could brute-force current_password.\n\n- Add createKeyedRateLimiter() for arbitrary string keys (e.g. user IDs)\n- Add passwordChangeLimiter: 5/min per user ID\n- Wire into PATCH /api/auth/me when new_password is provided\n- Separate from login rate limiter so legitimate users aren''t blocked","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TXgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlWIQAA4in3R+Ac1oBs1EuryE5hWI\n+xHzHafRdU9Mg1+AzXzSMw8DoddhGXrLTRo2YaPu9SLBfZurmHakhE5trm/HKSYO\nSqqO+qQF3VYmGXovtbqfW08REtHCELDbOx4IJbDZjrJtjWOREKgcNZfTeKTUQlWz\nU02TcWuOSZxA/jQgvVGOQEhNabbXqe7JzY7dE7CHZPvyC6gNmhz25Oc3jplbk3wt\naPq6iVQ09ai3jo1Gr4BipejJKpDNelWNjxXgCN6/CXEQIUdwYZg0E94NGq3MyWEd\nNP7F7Y9zBniiy91p6tg5oeFuZoMiY0dxLtB7hJ3wH7chOlLlLDh67IkoiXZKGrvF\nWO98699NcwGy6sBNltv6Z+qZ6i+eJnxc1nvER1FDfjVxk5sb+VjF5hnQWj9bty4g\nqSN8TlOIhCe3q/vJnbsmPsuDI7tSezrn5vnDlm3cP/p4rpnn9pc+k7NJX1/BTWYy\nVgqAYmrFNCUYZbHymt6o05v9nw8Tja8j51wAwJjyFZEQRgr593KWCqGra0qXwb0z\n2Ev5DAJs5OjHLmnMYelHoMPKoJDXwJ0YNOZfapb4gLUX8lrnaVCgHLv8g2l3VU90\ngzFeejA8GIbj8OKOfawC2Skl4gaQzDLnZPffKmgP8oWf1WgWtqV1VFaqlkVq/rKq\ncbefnHqZTSSjHFalHVOW\n=iSA1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T01:17:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/c94010d5ebe49af1f41cd3080f037567cd743745","node_id":"C_kwDOSKFDndoAKGM5NDAxMGQ1ZWJlNDlhZjFmNDFjZDMwODBmMDM3NTY3Y2Q3NDM3NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5","sha":"7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5"}],"sha":"c94010d5ebe49af1f41cd3080f037567cd743745","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/c94010d5ebe49af1f41cd3080f037567cd743745"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11137129?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AlessandroMartini","id":11137129,"login":"AlessandroMartini","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTM3MTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AlessandroMartini","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:39:31Z","email":"alessandromartini@gmail.com","name":"Alessandro Martini"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-10T17:39:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: prevent injection in shell scripts — sed, jq, and JSON construction (#572)\n\nThree classes of shell injection hardened across four scripts:\n\n1. sed metacharacter injection (install.sh, generate-env.sh):\n   Add sed_escape() and portable_sed() helpers; use for all variable interpolation.\n\n2. jq filter injection (agent-heartbeat.sh):\n   Replace string interpolation with jq --arg name for safe escaping.\n\n3. JSON string injection (notification-daemon.sh):\n   Use jq -n with --arg/--argjson for safe JSON construction.\n   Use curl --data-urlencode for URL parameter encoding.\n   Fix $? capture bug in refactored curl control flow.","tree":{"sha":"0f0a38a26d2e3769595f8d10427f632b2464e7a7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/trees/0f0a38a26d2e3769595f8d10427f632b2464e7a7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/commits/7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f0a38a26d2e3769595f8d10427f632b2464e7a7\nparent bbd783e9544a948ab700619fc15ecdeadc618429\nauthor Alessandro Martini <alessandromartini@gmail.com> 1775842771 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775842771 +0700\n\nfix: prevent injection in shell scripts — sed, jq, and JSON construction (#572)\n\nThree classes of shell injection hardened across four scripts:\n\n1. sed metacharacter injection (install.sh, generate-env.sh):\n   Add sed_escape() and portable_sed() helpers; use for all variable interpolation.\n\n2. jq filter injection (agent-heartbeat.sh):\n   Replace string interpolation with jq --arg name for safe escaping.\n\n3. JSON string injection (notification-daemon.sh):\n   Use jq -n with --arg/--argjson for safe JSON construction.\n   Use curl --data-urlencode for URL parameter encoding.\n   Fix $? capture bug in refactored curl control flow.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TXTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjlcQAJvZt27jBl3vXXcqZezxHuvn\n6a3nGKa7zCC3lx8Hbb5mF+6AibjkuL8gQepHMylf4DHFFYDjItVYIwceaRRgiaSk\nG7JUUMbr+AFoq6ekZxeEwWlScz8KfgUS55aLv1fhN+F2/PJt8MrYUu4F+ACYrIng\nUTrOLfafMWQwvwOhsB5S5Mw+2EPaV5aZExf8wG7IiFZ9aEAMfREmZ/s4w0Aje5qm\nvCHQADxlpgR9fbludLAL8LPq0fFBg24WanhuijntVjZ/YSNu4Q09dcvDss3WM6mv\ne8ZLzEE2m5nFoXEP/nmYU9H5zKFqeoL/lYgeXuz48SvHACWXyIDF5volDFHmfqe/\nFyIDPoiFWx9iku4ZgxEdZkfbUhgYuUqdvFxceCfzkTYvOg3Y7FnXeIvEjg9RNoYF\npoIeLydGSZQ5fYFo3SzuMl7m+Vz8PNz/GSfrubiEwg7hK2YOmZ5rEwKwPk8Z45gs\nYV7pacwDU5uRMOay+qVqSCTIIF2gOdJYd3mSH9W1m2E9CWst6t1Qr7GHx4Nj53TS\nexRJw1ar2h74ZYQrdTnh7x7zh+J/GiVEo8HxG8rZGEe+JE4lcv7LcwYUeFJEXWoK\nOvjrXE1wmdff020Z6XFa3XAnujkQuoKihTTGkS2W6WTYVTQjNBxIjwCpR6+W2G25\nflvpphiL8Qn5LWM0pRg7\n=9huK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T01:17:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/7f26c000f44130e05b9800b764d3c7c86be801c5","node_id":"C_kwDOSKFD