oogle OAuth user lookup to provider=''google'' users only.\nPreviously, matching by email alone could bind a new Google login to an\nexisting local or proxy account with the same email address — allowing\naccount takeover.\n\n- Tighten WHERE clause: provider=''google'' AND (provider_user_id=? OR lower(email)=?)\n- 7 behavioral tests with real in-memory SQLite covering takeover vectors","tree":{"sha":"c14172d6c4e0087334a08b251ae36ed26622b06b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/trees/c14172d6c4e0087334a08b251ae36ed26622b06b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/commits/bbd783e9544a948ab700619fc15ecdeadc618429","verification":{"payload":"tree c14172d6c4e0087334a08b251ae36ed26622b06b\nparent 4fd7e3cea877b467d0b1f31ac1697cd277185f10\nauthor Alessandro Martini <alessandromartini@gmail.com> 1775842739 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775842739 +0700\n\nfix: prevent Google OAuth account takeover via email collision (#571)\n\nRestrict the Google OAuth user lookup to provider=''google'' users only.\nPreviously, matching by email alone could bind a new Google login to an\nexisting local or proxy account with the same email address — allowing\naccount takeover.\n\n- Tighten WHERE clause: provider=''google'' AND (provider_user_id=? OR lower(email)=?)\n- 7 behavioral tests with real in-memory SQLite covering takeover vectors","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2TWzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM4oQAICkTVR6cG7J+hX9FdBDvMNr\nrO0YLuRQYstT0mD90EcAWvV4YNr6kYvBzCu0PmgJW0ZaOMkEeIHg2+tSeqNyN4L3\nWw9TcStEfmcAsHoG/zj+VIfTY/37b5+7HZx0DwbmoBpYOXBCjUpzxoKsIWQAD0Uw\nu4CytdyEzcLPyDq45FmDgA4FiDSamGu1VQA3Ws4rbuMuaAxneWI8qEdoOuy+GEiC\nExL/Zp0y+NGeh/f/n7O1NZfHz/qeQgasw1T1PhAHXnZ9BOzpAwfU+BlzSepaCoCU\nFt4nkYi2tgXyaj/ZZ+JEM3fjk0pKhmG+bdbjOQVUlHoEpR0QuWQeSFR2NzJ6p+vz\nNqhcjFrQdrHjCWRT1LKDimH5bkwjwB9AxDA7urgirsuOlfnh2z4CVFugRvJQVSS+\naIp1NFYS5ZdzfAk3qC0/9yXxRrMufVaMIGMoU3waYCRCKRp4fcdCJDgB3f7bMh5A\nXBrPB