779b642f1c561957","sha":"78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957"}],"sha":"27f6a3d6c14849196a0b7f47794f4a4d484a0176","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/27f6a3d6c14849196a0b7f47794f4a4d484a0176"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:50:16Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:50:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: direct Claude API task dispatch (gateway-free) (#473)\n\n* feat: direct Claude API task dispatch (gateway-free)\n\nAdd a built-in task executor that calls the Anthropic Messages API\ndirectly when no OpenClaw gateway is available. This makes the full\ntask lifecycle work out of the box — tasks are actually executed by\nClaude, not just tracked as metadata.\n\nHow it works:\n- Scheduler checks: is a gateway registered? If yes, use gateway\n  dispatch (existing path). If no, check for ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.\n- When dispatching via direct API: builds prompt from task + agent\n  SOUL, selects model by complexity (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku), calls\n  Claude Messages API, stores response as resolution.\n- Aegis reviews also work via direct API — same fallback logic.\n- Token usage is recorded in the token_usage table.\n- After dispatch, task moves to ''review'' for Aegis quality check.\n\nSetup: add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-... to .env.local\nNo gateway, no OpenClaw, no extra dependencies needed.\n\n* fix(tui): add missing ansi.blue color function","tree":{"sha":"c047be86d9fa97873cad775b8aa0daaae8d786a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/trees/c047be86d9fa97873cad775b8aa0daaae8d786a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/commits/78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957","verification":{"payload":"tree c047be86d9fa97873cad775b8aa0daaae8d786a3\nparent 32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774176616 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774176616 +0700\n\nfeat: direct Claude API task dispatch (gateway-free) (#473)\n\n* feat: direct Claude API task dispatch (gateway-free)\n\nAdd a built-in task executor that calls the Anthropic Messages API\ndirectly when no OpenClaw gateway is available. This makes the full\ntask lifecycle work out of the box — tasks are actually executed by\nClaude, not just tracked as metadata.\n\nHow it works:\n- Scheduler checks: is a gateway registered? If yes, use gateway\n  dispatch (existing path). If no, check for ANTHROPIC_API_KEY.\n- When dispatching via direct API: builds prompt from task + agent\n  SOUL, selects model by complexity (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku), calls\n  Claude Messages API, stores response as resolution.\n- Aegis reviews also work via direct API — same fallback logic.\n- Token usage is recorded in the token_usage table.\n- After dispatch, task moves to ''review'' for Aegis quality check.\n\nSetup: add ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-... to .env.local\nNo gateway, no OpenClaw, no extra dependencies needed.\n\n* fix(tui): add missing ansi.blue color function","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpv8loCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtlwQAIxqyPGuIV6I03x7P+BGH538\ndK26nTA/rxbHivWoj5kvwx4TXqkwkpveBNpkSuPjyJwV4BrCllR+ADbviAcCxQHo\nAHuAn+e1qLmzXWMKVXGYNIWFdJEE9FzooU+aoNb3Wbcm2kVhjC58SifDaGFqcb5T\nzg7/kkzwFlls2kisABuFiJ80PGy7kFG6y3jbRxtBXLChRGZS+C4IWESIisXLTXue\npQNdMb7LWsh/kOmwzZkmuenQablza7K1aAUPV12Jip6GztboguJzr3x4bKQhPHh2\nkhRYJz21lzLg9p4rDuGFkIMiMmFO3DuI72cUkyJSY9aC2IQmUhCTP/GC2+ACNSJP\n5xdaN2fPCldLZ9EbKPk1AGQ/ui2OZpI96mOJy2zpe3rKE66qguL1qIqRIKBEhnNg\nkyH7z3Hryfz43+refkFOZzLXj7taSMUvp579lAVi5CrccfRr4F20HQQb8mwUD9wf\nsh/k+VNLg1vNxj+Xujjbk2W5YnVvWXuVZfoib4FTHWRbQlHfsR+q5l/xaL3+VOMA\nXIQC+MkoSaA158rJ3E4Q5g5AH5MLl2NIZAECSr8pJ1vBxRjiyaHXmnbGhu54CH0I\n5JUzIXy1d9fhV2hvhFKsDWHYVKMTtYsd6p0BxVj1ScNOePs63USR5vPfN55/p8M5\nEhsQKfOEw4ojwGRtI24K\n=4czK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T01:17:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957","node_id":"C_kwDOSKFDndoAKDc4YjQ3MmE2M2FiNjBkNmM5NDkxYTZhMTc3OWI2NDJmMWM1NjE5NTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/beboopr/mission-control/commit/32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6","sha":"32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6"}],"sha":"78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/78b472a63ab60d6c9491a6a1779b642f1c561957"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93952610?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/0xNyk","id":93952610,"login":"0xNyk","node_id":"U_kgDOBZmaYg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/0xNyk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/commits/32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:25:07Z","email":"93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nyk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-22T10:25:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(tui): multi-step task creation + assign/priority actions (#472)\n\n* fix: add inline token editor to gateway card (#459)\n\nThe gateway card showed token status as read-only (set/none) with no\nway to update it. Users with a registered gateway but missing token\nhad to delete and re-add the gateway.\n\nAdd [edit] link next to the token indicator that expands an inline\npassword input. Supports Enter to save, Escape to cancel. Calls\nPUT /api/gateways with the token field (already supported by API).\n\n* feat(tui): multi-step task creation + assign/priority actions\n\n- [n]ew now prompts: title → description → priority → assign agent\n  (Enter skips optional steps)\n- [a]ssign key to assign selected task to an agent (shows available\n  agent names)\n- [p]riority key to change task priority (low/medium/high/critical)\n- Updated help bar and usage text with new keybindings\n\n* feat(tui): task detail view, activity feed, comments, priority column\n\n- Enter on a task opens full detail view showing: status, priority,\n  assignment, description, resolution, quality reviews, and comments\n- Task detail supports [s]tatus, [a]ssign, [p]riority, [c]omment,\n  [r]efresh actions\n- Activity feed below task list shows recent task/agent events with\n  timestamps and icons\n- Priority column added to task list with color coding\n- [e]dit key for title editing (moved from Enter)","tree":{"sha":"f6029a25e94a0db1b5cb0df2a75b42ff099598d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/trees/f6029a25e94a0db1b5cb0df2a75b42ff099598d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/beboopr/mission-control/git/commits/32447a4b08f2fd0a281584f97103de50bb376ec6","verification":{"payload":"tree f6029a25e94a0db1b5cb0df2a75b42ff099598d9\nparent 5bc5737d5611a2dcb0e441d561f359e9a6b18b5b\nauthor nyk <93952610+0xNyk@users.noreply.github.com> 1774175107 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774175107 +0700\n\nfeat(tui): multi-step task creation + assign/priority actions (#472)\n\n* fix: add inline token e