77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeamBandage/bandage-fe-web/git/trees/b65babddc7d1d70c76564c1f74b0fdd367bf7877"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeamBandage/bandage-fe-web/git/commits/39e3d64be03a2ed784255c38f55ebce9a2786985","verification":{"payload":"tree b65babddc7d1d70c76564c1f74b0fdd367bf7877\nparent 54b2127ea81d32dce3942cfbb3f7276b259526be\nauthor MinJu Chai <108432112+judymoody59@users.noreply.github.com> 1783188453 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783188453 +0900\n\n[BD-169] feat: 밴드 가입 신청 철회 및 신청 내역 UI 구현 (#248)\n\n* [BD-169] feat: 밴드 가입 신청 철회 기능 추가 및 band-applications API 정비\n\n- getMyApplicationForBand / useMyApplicationForBand 신규 구현\n  (GET /api/v1/bands/{bandId}/applications/me)\n- 밴드 상세 페이지: PENDING 상태 신청자에게 가입 철회 버튼 노출\n- useApplyBand / useWithdrawApplication: myApplication 쿼리 invalidate 추가\n- useDecideApplication: 잘못된 queryKey 버그 수정\n- queryKeys.band.myApplication 쿼리키 추가\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* [BD-169] feat: 가입 신청 내역 UI 추가 및 신청/철회 후 목록 즉시 반영\n\n- MyBandApplicationsSheet 컴포넌트 추가 (모바일 BottomSheet / PC Dialog 분리)\n- 밴드 목록 탭 옆 가입 신청 내역 버튼 추가 (BandsListPane, BandsMobileShell)\n- GET /api/v1/band-applications/me API 함수 및 훅 추가\n- 가입 신청/철회 성공 시 myApplications 쿼리 무효화 처리\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqSUvlCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAF9MQABUm+iM3b6ZCm50T5zoPEFnb\ntsEwt6Wtu8neltf8igY6lJC8e3nI8v8YZ68VXUHhXIbDeYQ8ne0U9JMGSIFdmL2N\nF48kz3opJWCotQ/ZK4a8erJ+MVIKFwfNupL5ZJUrDXrsikbYeJIA1c3s7fGweUhd\n3SUlN6FWbDH9b3gbIo8m3gDoYldsBoPmMGrS/RSTn+JqAi3++LCsujVFCubnr0lZ\njcYN9ryzLU4eHdt2N9+FVtyehd4ZLYoDdSbCeB3VjsjghkqBQ7EFk9n83/hXaICS\nKfGke0VhWgWY+99AKRqdjpA/Pjn2Ky2SVWIBTRWjiT9lxAxgBUZ8GGUIeDyD/BX3\nU9sQOej4D5OQLoCcWYhaSvzmx1sjoD59EQFrhbXpLS9CScKlteYZ/Wqr5psKXsXv\n1ikVvkb0gYt7RJhnjg9h152TAu26pfc8nSBZef1qDTzE/nRzC5zMDyOLRfeQGyVP\no1biIgre3z