age/bandage-fe-web/commits/4893c4ca81af5ceed8120511af97f277f6c27074"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108432112?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/judymoody59","id":108432112,"login":"judymoody59","node_id":"U_kgDOBnaK8A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/judymoody59","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeamBandage/bandage-fe-web/commits/acaf072d4fbfa39c6791a95b35c9c9660b3b7233/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T14:12:15Z","email":"108432112+judymoody59@users.noreply.github.com","name":"MinJu Chai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T14:12:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BD-110] fix: 구글 로그인 suppression 버그 수정 (#217)\n\n- GIS prompt()(One Tap) → renderButton() 방식으로 전환\n- One Tap은 브라우저가 억제(suppression)하면 항상 실패하는 구조적 한계 존재\n- renderButton은 계정 선택 팝업을 열어 억제 없이 항상 동작\n- use_fedcm_for_prompt 제거로 FedCM AbortError 해소\n- OAuthSection: 화면 밖 숨김 div에 renderButton 렌더링 후 커스텀 버튼 클릭 시 프로그래밍적으로 트리거\n- BE contract(POST /api/v1/auth/oauth/google idToken) 변경 없음\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b13dd3c719a2ac784b5e21a18b5eb1c6e646668f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TeamBandage/bandage-fe-web/git/trees/b13dd3c719