ps, and RCDO breadcrumbs\n- Add lifecycle status bar (DRAFT → LOCKED → RECONCILING → RECONCILED)\n- Add planner sidebar: summary card with chess distribution bar, lock\n  CTA with validation blockers, carry-forward section, activity feed\n- Fix commit form UX: collapsible outcome picker with \"Change\" button,\n  side-by-side Why/Evidence fields, chess+priority on one row, proper\n  modal backdrop blur\n- Update PlanHeader with serif week title and autosave indicator\n- Remove 72 accidentally committed .js/.js.map build artifacts from libs\n- Update .gitignore to prevent lib build artifacts from being recommitted\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8858d27ffa0fc8346bbf2cc41643076f15697332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/8858d27ffa0fc8346bbf2cc41643076f15697332"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/6c346b7c221b4e5330f94164d7c958f1fd2e52fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105263814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pakhunchan","id":105263814,"login":"pakhunchan","node_id":"U_kgDOBkYyxg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https: