.com","name":"pakhunchan"},"message":"Fix host blank-page: align pa-host serve with MF build+preview; expose package.json in workspace exports\n\nvite-plugin-federation only transforms the host''s import at vite build time,\nso running the host via plain `vite` dev leaves `import(''weekly_commit/*'')`\nuntouched and the browser crashes silently — same build+watch+preview pattern\nalready in use by weekly-commit-remote.\n\nSeparately, the host''s build invokes @rollup/plugin-commonjs (via @auth0/\nauth0-react) which deep-resolves `@st6/api-client/package.json`. Node 20''s\nstrict exports enforcement rejected the lookup because the three workspace\nlibs declared an `exports` field without `./package.json`. Added the\nself-export to api-client, shared-types, and shared-ui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d9fa8337fd12aa464e609242f8b6bfbfb8c76b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/5d9fa8337fd12aa464e609242f8b6bfbfb8c76b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/5034f04244d1950af196f1e95314436e250ad85c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105263814?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pakhunchan","id":105263814,"login":"pakhunchan","node_id":"U_kgDOBkYyxg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pakhunchan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commit/5034f04244d1950af196f1e95314436e250ad85c","node_id":"C_kwDOSKoaItoAKDUwMzRmMDQyNDRkMTk1MGFmMTk2ZjFlOTUzMTQ0MzZlMjUwYWQ4NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commit/3db7d81dc6a263f93f67ee608a8bde5b71c33a11","sha":"3db7d81dc6a263f93f67ee608a8bde5b71c33a11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commits/3db7d81dc6a263f93f67ee608a8bde5b71c33a11"}],"sha":"5034f04244d1950af196f1e95314436e250ad85c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commits/5034f04244d1950af196f1e95314436e250ad85c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commits/3db7d81dc6a263f93f67ee608a8bde5b71c33a11/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:45:26Z","email":"yash.vijay.kucheriya@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"yashkuceriya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:45:26Z","email":"yash.vijay.kucheriya@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"yashkuceriya"},"message":"Add CLAUDE.md — architectural narrative, decision log, AI workflow notes","tree":{"sha":"4f2b909cea8ca7db6e8a3f8b10f4c72bce5f1c7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/4f2b909cea8ca7db6e8a3f8b10f4c72bce5f1c7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/3db7d81dc6a263f93f67ee608a8bde5b71c33a11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commit/3db7d81dc6a263f93f67ee608a8bde5b71c33a11","node_id":"C_kwDOSKoaItoAKDNkYjdkODFkYzZhMjYzZjkzZjY3ZWU2MDhhOGJkZTViNzFjMzNhMTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commit/a5f93629a485553925e72aeaba95ca8cef9e6fd9","sha":"a5f93629a485553925e72aeaba95ca8cef9e6fd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a5f93629a485553925e72aeaba95ca8cef9e6fd9"}],"sha":"3db7d81dc6a263f93f67ee608a8bde5b71c33a11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commits/3db7d81dc6a263f93f67ee608a8bde5b71c33a11"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a5f93629a485553925e72aeaba95ca8cef9e6fd9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:34:12Z","email":"yash.vijay.kucheriya@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"yashkuceriya"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T14:34:12Z","email":"yash.vijay.kucheriya@challenger.gauntletai.com","name":"yashkuceriya"},"message":"Weekly Commit Module — full take-home scaffold\n\nA production-shaped micro-frontend that replaces 15Five with enforced\nRCDO alignment at the weekly unit of execution. Every commit hard-links\nto a Supporting Outcome; the plan moves through a 4-state lifecycle\n(DRAFT → LOCKED → RECONCILING → RECONCILED) with Carry Forward as a\ndeliberate action that creates child commits in next week''s plan.\n\nStack\n- Nx + Yarn workspaces (2 apps, 3 libs, 1 e2e)\n- React 18 + Vite 5 + Module Federation (pa-host + weekly-commit-remote)\n- Redux Toolkit + RTK Query with tag-based invalidation\n- Tailwind + Flowbite + a warm-cream Claude design language\n- Spring Boot 3.3 + Java 21 + Gradle Kotlin DSL\n- Postgres 16.4 + 11 Flyway migrations + recursive CTE for RCDO\n- Auth0 OAuth2 JWT (with a dev bypass) + scope-based @PreAuthorize\n- Outbox pattern + MS Graph Mail.Send stub for manager digest\n- Cypress 13 + Cucumber/Gherkin + Vitest + JUnit 5\n- Prod Dockerfiles + docker-compose.prod.yml + nginx configs\n\nRunning totals\n- 53 backend test classes, 30 frontend tests, 17 MockMvc + eval tests\n- 11 Flyway migrations, 13 entities, 7 enums, 11 REST controllers\n- 5 prep docs: CLAUDE, README, DEMO, VERIFY, INTERVIEW_PREP, DEPLOY\n\nSee CLAUDE.md for the decision log and INTERVIEW_PREP.md for the\ndefense of every choice.","tree":{"sha":"240a36211e9faa9a299e6c1170177c877757a1cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/git/trees/240a36211e9faa9a299e6c1170177c877757a1cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/git/commits/a5f93629a485553925e72aeaba95ca8cef9e6fd9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commit/a5f93629a485553925e72aeaba95ca8cef9e6fd9","node_id":"C_kwDOSKoaItoAKGE1ZjkzNjI5YTQ4NTU1MzkyNWU3MmFlYWJhOTVjYThjZWY5ZTZmZDk","parents":[],"sha":"a5f93629a485553925e72aeaba95ca8cef9e6fd9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commits/a5f93629a485553925e72aeaba95ca8cef9e6fd9"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/yashkuceriya/st6-weekly-commit/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=c7621bf3a02b06cdedff9c2df48f517d64affb4d&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A59%3A15.495Z"}');
