s for JIT-provisioned users\n\nNew DirectReportSeeder creates a fixed five-persona cast under each\nnewly-provisioned user with one current-week plan apiece spanning every\nPlanStateEnum, so the Team view isn''t empty on first login. Idempotent\nvia existsByManagerId, deterministic per-manager RNG, best-effort like\nHistorySeeder — same transaction as JIT user creation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0f7841784031400068199a851a0af5f1424ea5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/trees/e0f7841784031400068199a851a0af5f1424ea5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/commits/3b04536ae94696e68b9371d81a95a6671e112701","verification":{"payload":"tree e0f7841784031400068199a851a0af5f1424ea5c\nparent 2d2ba8395d3ecb0890b16a4824279d5797f3b86d\nauthor Ross Kuehl <168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com> 1776988377 -0500\ncommitter Ross Kuehl <168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com> 1776988377 -0500\n\nSeed direct reports for JIT-provisioned users\n\nNew DirectReportSeeder creates a fixed five-persona cast under each\nnewly-provisioned user with one current-week plan apiece spanning every\nPlanStateEnum, so the Team view isn''t empty on first login. Idempotent\nvia existsByManagerId, deterministic per-manager RNG, best-effort like\nHistorySeeder — same transaction as JIT user creation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgLZ1zt6HCtjxMy6xLf5m68u7Sbj\nrWzo5McBvGBui/OZIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBC8qve+8KeB7iP9pLGUhqmicsCbM3m6D9bsg8w3xgRbdHM7ZC5CcvAlsyDCAdXUin\nmBB2WfOl6bu2eu0NqdHQk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-23T23:53:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/