hoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T15:31:48Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"message":"Phase 8: demo recorder — ElevenLabs narration + ffmpeg screen capture\n\nAdds a `record-demo` Nx target that drives Playwright through scripted scenes,\nsynthesizes voiceover via ElevenLabs, and encodes the result with ffmpeg.\nIncludes fixture helpers, narration cache, scene definitions, and a Mux upload\nstep. `.env.example` documents the required API key.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40e0aaffa29ec4ac5322c875b3cb1b9f639f5aa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/trees/40e0aaffa29ec4ac5322c875b3cb1b9f639f5aa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/commits/a009781def32b3b963be09e1721949bf1486004c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/a009781def32b3b963be09e1721949bf1486004c","node_id":"C_kwDOSKrgsNoAKGEwMDk3ODFkZWYzMmIzYjk2M2JlMDllMTcyMTk0OWJmMTQ4NjAwNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/10ce084fc2b0a72ce42abb2c1eb9063975284b4c","sha":"10ce084fc2b0a72ce42abb2c1eb9063975284b4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/10ce084fc2b0a72ce42abb2c1eb9063975284b4c"}],"sha":"a009781def32b3b963be09e1721949bf1486004c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/a009781def32b3b963be09e1721949bf1486004c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/10ce084fc2b0a72ce42abb2c1eb9063975284b4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T13:55:37Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T13:55:37Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"message":"Phase 7: tests, polish, demo — README, Playwright, CI e2e + visual\n\nRounds out BDD coverage with manager-unlock, optimistic-lock 409,\n2000-row perf, and drill-through scenarios. Adds Playwright visual\nregression for every top-level view in light + dark with baselines\ncommitted. Frontend CI grows `e2e` (Cypress on push-to-main) and\n`visual` (Playwright) jobs.\n\nHost gains a `MockAuth0Provider` that the existing `auth_stub` cookie\nnow actually triggers — lets Cypress + Playwright drive the SPA\nwithout redirecting to Auth0. Moves dev ports 5000/5001 → 4200/4201\nto sidestep macOS AirPlay, which was silently returning blank 403\npages during local baseline generation. `webServer.cwd` pinned to\nrepo root so Yarn Berry can resolve workspaces when Playwright\nspawns the dev servers.\n\nREADME is the 12-section pitch: problem, ASCII + Mermaid\narchitecture, ERD, how-to-run, ADR index, layered testing strategy,\nscoped trade-offs, unknowns, follow-ups, run-cost estimate.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4caa14f2231edfbc643a0b1723a5b115bd6dd85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/trees/e4caa14f2231edfbc643a0b1723a5b115bd6dd85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/commits/10ce084fc2b0a72ce42abb2c1eb9063975284b4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/10ce084fc2b0a72ce42abb2c1eb9063975284b4c","node_id":"C_kwDOSKrgsNoAKDEwY2UwODRmYzJiMGE3MmNlNDJhYmIyYzFlYjkwNjM5NzUyODRiNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/8416068655ee01e13f1524daea88a8d164f6d7c2","sha":"8416068655ee01e13f1524daea88a8d164f6d7c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/8416068655ee01e13f1524daea88a8d164f6d7c2"}],"sha":"10ce084fc2b0a72ce42abb2c1eb9063975284b4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/10ce084fc2b0a72ce42abb2c1eb9063975284b4c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/8416068655ee01e13f1524daea88a8d164f6d7c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T13:55:15Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T13:55:15Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"message":"Phase 6: reconciliation UI, chess layer, carry-forward\n\nReconciliation view ships the side-by-side planned/status/actual layout\nwith five one-click verdict buttons and optimistic PATCH per commit.\nChess layer exposes server-owned label/tooltip overrides via\n`/api/metadata/chess-categories` so ST6 can tune semantics without a\ndeploy; enum + selector stubs are flagged `TODO(unknowns-2)`.\nCarry-forward materialises as a `@Scheduled` side effect on\nRECONCILED → next-week DRAFT, cloning PARTIAL/MISSED commits with\n`carried_from_commit_id`; the lineage chip surfaces depth on the\nreconcile row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"700d2ddbcf65d176fe95ee71a08e62b0ec304fa6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/trees/700d2ddbcf65d176fe95ee71a08e62b0ec304fa6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/commits/8416068655ee01e13f1524daea88a8d164f6d7c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/8416068655ee01e13f1524daea88a8d164f6d7c2","node_id":"C_kwDOSKrgsNoAKDg0MTYwNjg2NTVlZTAxZTEzZjE1MjRkYWVhODhhOGQxNjRmNmQ3YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/286c0dacd519beaf33358678b5e5bdab45131627","sha":"286c0dacd519beaf33358678b5e5bdab45131627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/286c0dacd519beaf33358678b5e5bdab45131627"}],"sha":"8416068655ee01e13f1524daea88a8d164f6d7c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/8416068655ee01e13f1524daea88a8d164f6d7c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/286c0dacd519beaf33358678b5e5bdab45131627/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T04:07:19Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T04:07:19Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"message":"Phase 5: manager dashboard, plan reviews, SQS audit consumer\n\nTrack 5A — Backend dashboard query + endpoint:\n- WeeklyPlanRepository#findDashboard: HQL with aggregate CASE/SUM over\n  LEFT JOIN p.commits; Slice<ManagerRowAggregate> avoids the count query\n  (ADR-0004); single GROUP BY pass replaces correlated SIZE(p.commits).\n- ManagerDashboardService + ManagerController\n  (@PreAuthorize MANAGER + @PageableDefault user.displayName ASC).\n- Bucket4j per-user rate limiter (60 req/min) → 429 ProblemDetail with\n  Retry-After.\n- ManagerDashboardIT + ManagerDashboardRateLimiterTest + disabled\n  2000-row ManagerDashboardPerfIT.\n\nTrack 5A — Plan review endpoint:\n- POST /api/weekly-plans/{id}/reviews (idempotent) mirrors the latest\n  review onto weekly_plan.manager_reviewed_at + manager_reviewer_id and\n  appends to a new plan_review_comment table.\n- PlanService.load now allows owner OR owner-manager (dashboard drill-\n  through). PlanReviewIT asserts the auth matrix + idempotency gating.\n\nTrack 5C — SQS audit consumer + observability:\n- Flyway V5 adds plan_audit_log (PK = SNS MessageId for dedup).\n- SqsAuditConsumer polls audit-q on @Scheduled + @SchedulerLock; SNS\n  envelope unwrap; DataIntegrityViolationException on the PK collapses\n  at-least-once delivery into exactly-once persistence.\n- Micrometer counters: plan.transition{from,to,command},\n  plan.idempotency.hits, plan.audit.consumed, plan.audit.duplicate.\n  @Timed(\"plan.dashboard.latency\") histogram exposed via /actuator\n  /prometheus.\n\nTrack 5B — Frontend:\n- TanStack Table v8 + @tanstack/react-virtual ManagerDashboard with\n  sortable columns, filter pills (Needs review, Alignment < 80%),\n  drill-through, RTK Query 30s pollingInterval.\n- ReviewPane component + PlanView review-mode (?reviewMode=true) swaps\n  useGetCurrentPlanQuery for useGetPlanByIdQuery and renders read-only.\n- MSW-backed Vitest (<ManagerDashboard />, <ReviewPane />) + Cypress\n  manager-roll-up.feature (3rd BDD feature).\n\nOpenAPI: adds POST /reviews, PlanReviewRequest schema, planId +\nreviewTurnaroundSeconds on ManagerRow. Fixtures regenerated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20ce089b57b1a50ea62344a3b993d46f17342bc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/trees/20ce089b57b1a50ea62344a3b993d46f17342bc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/commits/286c0dacd519beaf33358678b5e5bdab45131627","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/286c0dacd519beaf33358678b5e5bdab45131627","node_id":"C_kwDOSKrgsNoAKDI4NmMwZGFjZDUxOWJlYWYzMzM1ODY3OGI1ZTViZGFiNDUxMzE2Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/1f6ccea8d4e9cb7b8ebf0540478b252f6b14098e","sha":"1f6ccea8d4e9cb7b8ebf0540478b252f6b14098e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/1f6ccea8d4e9cb7b8ebf0540478b252f6b14098e"}],"sha":"286c0dacd519beaf33358678b5e5bdab45131627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/286c0dacd519beaf33358678b5e5bdab45131627"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/1f6ccea8d4e9cb7b8ebf0540478b252f6b14098e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T03:23:32Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T03:23:32Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"message":"Phases 2–4: domain, CRUD, state-machine transitions, scheduler, SNS\n\nPhase 2 — domain & UI shell:\n  RCDO hierarchy (RallyCry → DefiningObjective → Outcome → SupportingOutcome)\n  with Flyway V2; WeeklyPlan + WeeklyCommit + PlanTransition with V3 and JPA\n  optimistic locking. Sealed-type PlanStateMachine (ADR-0003). UI scaffolding\n  in apps/weekly-commit (routes, views, components, fixtures) + libs/ui shared\n  components (StateBadge, ChessChip, RcdoPath, WeekPicker, VarianceStrip,\n  ActionButtons, EmptyState, ErrorBoundary, RoleGuard).\n\nPhase 3 — CRUD & idempotency:\n  PlanController + CommitController with owner-scoped access, state-sensitive\n  field allow-lists, and Resilience4j @Retry on optimistic-lock conflicts.\n  Servlet-filter-based IdempotencyKey interceptor (24h replay window),\n  CommitFormModal with react-hook-form + zod validation and RTK Query\n  optimistic updates, plus a first Cucumber feature (draft-plan.feature).\n\nPhase 4 — state-machine transitions + lifecycle:\n  POST /api/weekly-plans/{id}/transitions and GET /{id}/history endpoints;\n  PlanTransitionService composes the state machine, JPA @Version save, audit\n  row insert, and AFTER_COMMIT ApplicationEvent in one @Transactional.\n  PlanEventSnsPublisher bridges to the SNS plan-events topic via AWS SDK v2\n  (LocalStack-aware, @ConditionalOnProperty so tests don''t wire SNS).\n  Hourly PlanAutoTransitionScheduler + ShedLock for cluster-safe\n  Monday-09:00 AutoLock and Friday-17:00 StartReconcile (per-user-tz native\n  SQL). Three transition modals (Submit plan / Submit reconciliation /\n  Manager unlock with ≥10-char reason guard) wired into PlanView; RTK\n  endpoints transitionPlan + updateCommitActual + getPlanHistory. Lifecycle\n  Cucumber feature + step definitions.\n\nTests: backend jacocoTestCoverageVerification ≥80/70 green, SpotBugs clean,\nSpotless clean; frontend nx test green across api-client (11), ui (auto),\nweekly-commit (22). Concurrency and scheduler ITs exercise the real\nTestcontainers Postgres.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"014d47872533f0f716293d0a1fef69e02027d496","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/trees/014d47872533f0f716293d0a1fef69e02027d496"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/commits/1f6ccea8d4e9cb7b8ebf0540478b252f6b14098e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/1f6ccea8d4e9cb7b8ebf0540478b252f6b14098e","node_id":"C_kwDOSKrgsNoAKDFmNmNjZWE4ZDRlOWNiN2I4ZWJmMDU0MDQ3OGIyNTJmNmIxNDA5OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/77e83eca3593098293f2c9f4fd7d983d9d65d5f5","sha":"77e83eca3593098293f2c9f4fd7d983d9d65d5f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/77e83eca3593098293f2c9f4fd7d983d9d65d5f5"}],"sha":"1f6ccea8d4e9cb7b8ebf0540478b252f6b14098e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/1f6ccea8d4e9cb7b8ebf0540478b252f6b14098e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/77e83eca3593098293f2c9f4fd7d983d9d65d5f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T21:46:23Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T21:46:23Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"message":"Phase 1: parallel scaffolding — backend, frontend MF, local-dev infra\n\nBrings the three Phase 1 tracks online end-to-end so `docker compose up`\nplus `bootRun --spring.profiles.active=local` plus `nx serve host/weekly-commit`\nproduces an authenticated-ish hello-world stack with all contracts wired up.\n\nTrack 1A — Backend (Spring Boot 3.3.5 on Java 21, Gradle):\n- AbstractAuditingEntity + SpringSecurityAuditorAware (JWT email-claim first,\n  sub fallback, \"system\" for unauthenticated), bound via @EnableJpaAuditing.\n- SecurityConfig: stateless JWT resource-server with explicit AudienceValidator;\n  JwtDecoder is @ConditionalOnMissingBean + @ConditionalOnProperty so test\n  slices can stub it and so an unconfigured deploy fails fast.\n- ProblemDetail handlers for 400/401/403/404/409/500 incl. optimistic-lock\n  and a placeholder IllegalTransitionException for the Phase 2 state machine.\n- Flyway core on the classpath but disabled at startup (ADR-0006) — local +\n  test profiles re-enable it for DX.\n- Testcontainers Postgres via @ServiceConnection (ADR-0007). HealthEndpointIT\n  + SecurityConfigAuthTest ride the shared container.\n- JaCoCo ≥ 80/70, Spotless (Palantir 2.50.0 with origin/main ratchet),\n  SpotBugs effort=MAX reportLevel=HIGH. Layered-jar Dockerfile on eclipse-\n  temurin 21 with non-root user + -XX:MaxRAMPercentage=75.\n- Testcontainers 1.20.4 + api.version=1.43 sysprop to clear Docker Desktop\n  29''s \"client version too old\" rejection; socket override to ~/.docker/run\n  so Ryuk can bind-mount.\n\nTrack 1B — Frontend (Vite 5 + React 18 + @module-federation/vite, RTK Query):\n- Host (:5000) loads weekly_commit remote (:5001) over MF with singleton\n  react / react-dom / react-redux / @reduxjs/toolkit / @auth0/auth0-react\n  (ADR-0001, ADR-0002). strictVersion on all shared deps.\n- Auth0TokenBridge: module-scoped token-getter ref (not React context) so\n  RTK Query''s prepareHeaders can await a fresh token from a non-component\n  boundary (ADR-0005). baseQueryWithReauth serialises refresh via async-mutex.\n- emptyApi declares the tag types Phase 3 will inject endpoints against\n  (Plan, Commit, RcdoNode, SupportingOutcome, TeamRollup, ChessCategory).\n- Host owns the Redux store; `reducerInjector.injectReducer(key, reducer)`\n  idempotent `store.replaceReducer(combineReducers(...))` for remote slices.\n- Remote exposes ./App, ./routes, ./reducer, ./register — the inferred\n  PM-remote shape flagged as TODO(unknowns-4) pending ST6 clarification.\n- Flat ESLint 9 config with prettier LAST; Tailwind 3.4 + Flowbite 2.5 +\n  darkMode: ''class'' preset shared via libs/ui.\n- Vitest smoke test per project; all four pass.\n\nTrack 1C — Local dev + CI:\n- docker-compose: postgres 16.4-alpine (matches Terraform RDS engine version),\n  localstack 4.0.3 (sqs/sns/secretsmanager/ssm), mock-oauth2-server 2.1.10 on\n  :8888 (not :8080 — Spring Boot claims that).\n- localstack/init/00-resources.sh provisions plan-events SNS + 3 SQS queues\n  + 3 DLQs + wcm/db secret, idempotent.\n- scripts/dev-bootstrap.sh one-shot launcher (preflight, compose up, API +\n  nx serve in parallel, signal-trap cleanup).\n- Helm chart for weekly-commit-api with Flyway pre-upgrade hook Job\n  (ADR-0006), IRSA ServiceAccount, HPA, PDB, ingress (ALB) behind a flag,\n  preStop sleep 5s + 45s grace. Terraform skeleton for EKS / RDS Multi-AZ /\n  S3 + CloudFront with CORS restricted to host origin (not \"*\").\n- GH Actions: backend.yml (gradle build + jacoco + spotbugs), frontend.yml\n  (nx affected lint/test/build with nrwl/nx-set-shas), ci.yml umbrella\n  (actionlint, helm lint, Trivy pinned to SHA, OIDC-only AWS via\n  aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials — no long-lived keys).\n- Every action pinned to a commit SHA (supply-chain landmine).\n\nEnd-to-end join-point verified:\n  /actuator/health/readiness = UP (Flyway migrated, Postgres reachable)\n  /actuator/health/liveness  = UP\n  /api/weekly-plans/current  = 401 (JWT enforced)\n  :5000 host → 200 text/html with MF runtime; :5001 remoteEntry.js → 200\n  mock-oauth2 discovery exposes http://localhost:8888/default as issuer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"02efabeb4ee3694ae3a329a6745fe975b65f67e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/trees/02efabeb4ee3694ae3a329a6745fe975b65f67e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/commits/77e83eca3593098293f2c9f4fd7d983d9d65d5f5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/77e83eca3593098293f2c9f4fd7d983d9d65d5f5","node_id":"C_kwDOSKrgsNoAKDc3ZTgzZWNhMzU5MzA5ODI5M2YyYzlmNGZkN2Q5ODNkOWQ2NWQ1ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen/st6/commit/ef5b9f65fd88235362c632731a4531d56c1aeb25","sha":"ef5b9f65fd88235362c632731a4531d56c1aeb25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/ef5b9f65fd88235362c632731a4531d56c1aeb25"}],"sha":"77e83eca3593098293f2c9f4fd7d983d9d65d5f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/77e83eca3593098293f2c9f4fd7d983d9d65d5f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/168792663?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shoyu-ramen","id":168792663,"login":"shoyu-ramen","node_id":"U_kgDOCg-SVw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shoyu-ramen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/commits/ef5b9f65fd88235362c632731a4531d56c1aeb25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-22T20:04:18Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-22T20:04:18Z","email":"168792663+shoyu-ramen@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ross Kuehl"},"message":"Phase 0: foundation — Nx workspace, ADRs, OpenAPI contract\n\nScaffolds the monorepo skeleton per IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md §Phase 0:\n\n- Nx 20.3 + Yarn 4 workspace with 4 apps (host, weekly-commit, api,\n  weekly-commit-e2e) and 3 libs (ui, api-client, contracts). `nx graph`\n  enumerates all 7 projects.\n- 7 ADRs in docs/adr/ covering the decisions the interview will ask\n  about first: MF Vite plugin choice, host-owned Redux, sealed-type\n  state machine, Slice-vs-Page, Auth0TokenBridge, Flyway placement,\n  Testcontainers over H2.\n- libs/contracts/openapi.yaml — OpenAPI 3.1 spec for all 12 endpoints\n  with shared DTOs (PlanResponse, Commit, ManagerRow, ProblemDetail).\n  Passes `redocly lint` and generates 851 lines of TS via\n  `yarn contracts:generate`.\n- docs/unknowns.md — six open questions for ST6, each cross-referenced\n  to TODO(unknowns-N) markers that will be added in later phases.\n\nExit criteria met: `yarn install` ✓, `nx show projects` lists 7 ✓,\n`yarn contracts:lint` green ✓, 7 ADRs committed ✓.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f41906bd96ae6d2271908a47c56f28e10752633","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/shoyu-ramen/st6/git/trees/5f41906bd