:{"date":"2026-07-23T04:09:26Z","email":"uddhavbiswas379@gmail.com","name":"uv379"},"message":"docs: add local env reference; remove redundant frontend docs index\n\n- Add docs/env-reference.md — every local env var (shell, gateway, auth-service,\n  infra) with its placeholder value, the port map, and the shared-JWT_SECRET\n  contract. Placeholders only; real secrets stay in each service''s .env.\n- Delete docs/frontend/README.md — it was only a docs index, which duplicates the\n  root README''s role. New docs are standalone files under docs/.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c00144f47c323cf71953ec5149ebe793623799b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/git/trees/c00144f47c323cf71953ec5149ebe793623799b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/git/commits/5655410dfb97fef12f7128aaf06aac8b94fe311f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79748930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uv379","id":79748930,"login":"uv379","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NzQ4OTMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commit/5655410dfb97fef12f7128aaf06aac8b94fe311f","node_id":"C_kwDOSLD_4doAKDU2NTU0MTBkZmI5N2ZlZjEyZjcxMjhhYWYwNmFhYzhiOTRmZTMxMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commit/e27433edd7403d81c31862b3526cd1af7bb08f3f","sha":"e27433edd7403d81c31862b3526cd1af7bb08f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commits/e27433edd7403d81c31862b3526cd1af7bb08f3f"}],"sha":"5655410dfb97fef12f7128aaf06aac8b94fe311f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commits/5655410dfb97fef12f7128aaf06aac8b94fe311f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79748930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uv379","id":79748930,"login":"uv379","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NzQ4OTMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commits/e27433edd7403d81c31862b3526cd1af7bb08f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:05:04Z","email":"uddhavbiswas379@gmail.com","name":"uv379"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T04:05:04Z","email":"uddhavbiswas379@gmail.com","name":"uv379"},"message":"feat(frontend): standard response envelope, axios SDK, auth wiring, and shared toasts\n\nConnect the frontend to the backend end-to-end and standardise how every\nservice replies, so adding a service is a zero-change event for the client.\n\nBackend — one response envelope for every service:\n- Standard { success, message, data, meta } shape in both languages.\n- FastAPI: app/core/responses.py + exception_handlers.py (auth-service as the\n  template); all routers converted, rbac raises AppError.\n- Express: src/middleware/respond.middleware.js (api-gateway as the template);\n  gateway''s own 401/429/502/500 + catch-all 404 enveloped.\n- Contract: packages/shared-schemas (Zod + Pydantic) + docs/api-response-format.md.\n\nFrontend — the shell now really talks to the backend:\n- @orbitdesk/sdk: axios instance with interceptors — auth header, envelope\n  unwrap (returns data), single-flight 401->refresh->retry, ApiError with\n  code/details, and automatic toast hooks. Typed auth endpoints.\n- apps/shell/src/auth/*: Zustand store (access token in memory only),\n  AuthProvider bootstrap via /auth/refresh, silent token refresh, useAuth.\n- RequireAuth guard on the /app branch; Login/Signup/Sidebar wired for real.\n\nToasts — shared, backend-message-first:\n- @orbitdesk/ui: sonner wrapper (toast + <Toaster/>), themed with design tokens.\n- API calls toast themselves using the server''s message; frontend text is a\n  fallback only. Opt out with silentError / silentSuccess.\n- @orbitdesk/ui, @orbitdesk/sdk, sonner declared Module Federation singletons so\n  every MFE shares one toast queue and one API client.\n\nVerified: auth flow through the gateway (signup/login/refresh/logout/me, cookie\nrotation, 401/409/422 codes); SDK integration test 8/8; shell type-check + build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db11852f931a48f6c642b9e424d9e7adf7117018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/git/trees/db11852f931a48f6c642b9e424d9e7adf7117018"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/git/commits/e27433edd7403d81c31862b3526cd1af7bb08f3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79748930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uv379","id":79748930,"login":"uv379","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NzQ4OTMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commit/e27433edd7403d81c31862b3526cd1af7bb08f3f","node_id":"C_kwDOSLD_4doAKGUyNzQzM2VkZDc0MDNkODFjMzE4NjJiMzUyNmNkMWFmN2JiMDhmM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commit/266ef4d7756becf224cea7e24a8dc9f894b064e3","sha":"266ef4d7756becf224cea7e24a8dc9f894b064e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commits/266ef4d7756becf224cea7e24a8dc9f894b064e3"}],"sha":"e27433edd7403d81c31862b3526cd1af7bb08f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commits/e27433edd7403d81c31862b3526cd1af7bb08f3f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/79748930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h