ts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/uv379","id":79748930,"login":"uv379","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NzQ4OTMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uv379","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/uv379/orbitdesk-agentic-workspace/commits/d54e611c6c17929e2796f12276aea744b95a7875/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T00:16:13Z","email":"uddhavbiswas379@gmail.com","name":"uv379"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T00:16:13Z","email":"uddhavbiswas379@gmail.com","name":"uv379"},"message":"feat(api-gateway): implement Express reverse-proxy gateway\n\nFill the empty api-gateway scaffold into a runnable, well-commented\nstateless reverse proxy (port 8080). Pipeline: helmet -> cors ->\nrequestId -> logger -> otel(stub) -> rateLimit -> auth(JWT) -> routes\n(proxy) -> errorHandler. Redis-optional rate limiting with in-memory\nfallback; Zod-validated env; clean 502 when a downstream is down.\n\nAlso:\n- docs: add CHANGELOG.md (progress log) and CLAUDE.md (standing rules)\n- docs: README kept to setup/usage; api-gateway marked runnable\n- chore: env template named .env.local (not .env.example); .gitignore\n  tracks the template while keeping real .env ignored\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0fb8c8dcc4d14ddea1636ed27a7620650f15fa10","url":"https://api.