Implemented hard active order cap (max 2) for Cash on Delivery checkout to prevent fake order spam and inventory exhaustion. Used Postgres transaction-level advisory locks and normalized phone number checks for safe enforcement before stock reduction.\n- **Documentation**: Generated  for API security posture.\n- **Documentation**: Generated  to verify all completed phases and architecture.\n- **Documentation**: Generated  containing the final QA launch decision, smoke tests, cost review, and risk register.\n- **Documentation**: Updated  and  with links to the final QA verdict.\n- **Verification**: Successfully ran full production builds for both the Express backend and Next.js frontend with zero errors.\n\nAll critical codebase blockers have been officially resolved.\nStatus: CONDITIONAL GO for launch (pending ImageKit staging verification and Render automated backups).","tree":{"sha":"79b7bbfd6b79613db34722cb013d30c2c7f3c315","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamirMD0/Connect-Shop/git/trees/79b7bbfd6b79613db34722cb013d30c2c7f3c315"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SamirMD0/Connect-Shop/git/commits/daffb870d9f6f5ed1c9fc4285c188f8a490bfa7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/211663856?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamirMD0/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamirMD0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamirMD0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamirMD0/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/SamirMD0","id":211663856,"login":"SamirMD0","node_id":"U_kgDODJ278A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamirMD0/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamirMD0/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SamirMD0/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.g